<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Trust to write off bad loans of 400 bln yen.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Trust to write off bad loans of 400 bln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd plans to write off non-performing loans totalling 400 billion yen in the business year to March 31, 1997, a bank official told a news conference on Monday.</p>
<p>The bank was likely to finalise its plan to write off its remaining bad loan holdings this business year, the official added.</p>
</text>
